{"id":"c8ff2f79b6a4018b","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-congruence-modular.md","title":"Congruence Modular","display":"df-congruence-modular — Congruence Modular","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-congruence-modular","aliases":["93-df-congruence-modular"],"display":"df-congruence-modular — Congruence Modular","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","[[93-df-modular-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-congruence-modular"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-congruence-modular</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-congruence-modular — Congruence Modular"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ad379574ef6f3a71\" href=\"?note=ad379574ef6f3a71\" title=\"93-df-modular-lattice\">93-df-modular-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}\\)</span> (congruence-lattice constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" href=\"?note=135c0cfcbae1f3c5\" title=\"93-df-congruence-lattice\">93-df-congruence-lattice</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}\\)</span> (modular-lattice predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ad379574ef6f3a71\" href=\"?note=ad379574ef6f3a71\" title=\"93-df-modular-lattice\">93-df-modular-lattice</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}\\)</span> (congruence-modularity predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}modular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}congruence\\text{-}modular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CongMod}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\mathrm{ModularLat}_{93}(\\mathrm{ConLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"135c0cfcbae1f3c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-modular-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"ad379574ef6f3a71","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93